{"ts":"2026-09-05T18:17:53.424Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.6","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"769b3cbfbbd845ee70acca80","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.6","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-05T18:17:53.424Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-05T18:17:53.424Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Pinned exact devDependencies: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.27 -> 2026.9.5, pm-changelog 2026.8.30 -> 2026.9.2, pm-ops 2026.9.2 -> 2026.9.5.\n\nNo change to scripts/verify-release-changelog-date.ts: origin/main already treats the unflagged run as a control that must differ from the flagged heading, not as a clock-derived string. Against 2026.9.2 the live gate printed:\n\nok - with the flag the heading is version-derived: ## 2026.1.2-2 - 2026-01-02\nok - the flag changes the heading: '## 2026.1.2-2 - 2026-01-02' with it, '## 2026.1.2-2' without (derived some other way)\n\nnpm run coverage: 220 pass / 0 fail. npm run changelog:check, verify:release-publish-attestation, verify:release-changelog-date, audit:prod, pack:dry-run, accept:packed all exited 0.\n\npm health --strict-exit exits 0 on a CI-shaped checkout (no gitignored .agents/pm/extensions/). Local copies of pm-csv 2026.8.16 and pm-github 2026.8.18 still resolve nested @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.21 and fail health; those paths are gitignored and are not part of this pin."}]}],"before_hash":"d46c5062ef735cf84d9e5ed7d01f098bd76ff4748ba827064d921bc0d5243947","after_hash":"1aeebb3a18b89b43dc2aa067ea2bbafd02be064b2b1b46d9383fee4a1510c464","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"3de24c62e6152828f1415e946de019b2cfd14c6141f41a9f5989c3462c42d890"}
